From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rumisle <why-excuse-quail@duck.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 22:10:20 +0800
Subject: server: API failures answer with a JSON error; the client names the
 request

A defect (e.g. SQLITE_CORRUPT) or an unknown route returned an empty 500/404, which
the web client could only report as "ClientError: UnsupportedContentType", and
the defect was logged at INFO. /api/ requests now get {_tag, message} naming the
route and the cause, defects are logged at ERROR, and the client's
UnsupportedContentType includes the status and path.

Ocelot-Patch: server/api-errors

